WEBVTT

00:04:29.558 --> 00:04:32.001
But the chocolate cake
looks so good and delicious,

00:04:32.025 --> 00:04:33.486
and it's right in front of me,

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.645
and the diet can wait 'til tomorrow.

00:04:35.669 --> 00:04:37.701
I used to love the comedian Steven Wright.

00:04:37.725 --> 00:04:39.710
He would have these Zen-like quips.

00:04:40.072 --> 00:04:41.709
My favorite one was this:

00:04:42.187 --> 00:04:44.466
"Hard work pays off in the future,

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:46.864
but laziness pays off right now."

00:04:46.888 --> 00:04:48.346
(Laughter)

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:50.694
And patients also have present bias.

00:04:51.265 --> 00:04:52.899
If you have high blood pressure,

00:04:52.923 --> 00:04:55.455
even if you would desperately
like to avoid a stroke,

00:04:55.479 --> 00:04:58.487
and you know that taking
your antihypertensive medications

00:04:58.511 --> 00:05:01.213
is one of the best ways
to reduce that risk,